  "scope": [
    "If conditions and ordinary expressions share Access/call extraction. Unknown return values do not by themselves discard a supported callee access prefix.",
    "and/or right-side accesses carry their execution guards. Unknown left predicates conservatively stop hoisting; no general evaluator for opaque predicates or arbitrary loops.",
    "Builtin node isinstance is evaluated only on actual safe existing objects and declared runtime classes. No descriptor/user function execution, cast-based type inference or planning-time object materialization.",
    "Recipe ownership Access waits at the callsite after jobj; original condition and its membership result execute natively once. Existing after-condition requirements hook remains.",
    "Both configurations use GIL-off threads and identical native scenarios/semantic oracles and planning-read exclusion. Coverage is successful foreground Session demand covered by payload, not SQL hit rate or semantic necessity.",
    "Unused payload count is not a proof of zero semantically unnecessary reads; root-neighbor payload may be avoidable with a separate membership-query optimization."
